</p></div>
<div class="fn" id="fn20"><p>
<em>ADHD, attention-deficit hyperactivity disorder; BE, binge eating; DERS-16, Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale-16; TAS-20, Toronto Alexithymia Scale-20; BFI, big five inventory.</em>
